   "text_original_textlayer": "In the reaction of formation of sulphur trioxide\nby contact process \n2\n2\n3\n2SO\nO\n2SO\n\n\n\n the\nrate \nof \nreaction \nwas \nmeasured \nas\n4\n2\nd[O ]\n2.5 10\ndt\n\n\n\n mol L–1 s–1. The rate of\nreaction in terms of [SO2] in mol L–1s–1 will be",
